meta {
  name: Referrals
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  The referral program: programs, reward rules, codes, referrals, the reward
  ledger and the blocked-domain list. Needs the `referrals.manage` ability
  (owner, operator, finance).

  List requests store the first row's id so the rest of the folder works:
  `referralProgramId`, `referralRuleId`, `referralCodeId`, `referralId`,
  `referralRewardId`, `blockedDomainId`. `Rewards - Grant Manual` needs
  `userId` set by hand (a user's id, e.g. from `SuperAdmin/Users/List`).

  Every change is written to the audit log (`SuperAdmin/Audit Log/List`).
  The artisan equivalents are the `referrals:*` commands.
}
